
Collection of SNMP MIBs from various sources.

The MIB files may have been renamed to match <mib_name>.mib.

The folder structure inside mibs/ does not follow any particular
naming convention. Its sole purpose is to keep related MIBs
together. One day I might group by Enterprise Numbers but
for now this will do.

I also cleaned up some MIB files with the 'smidump' command.



